assume any duty to update forward-looking statements. Words such as &ldquo;anticipate,&rdquo; &ldquo;believe,&rdquo; &ldquo;could,&rdquo;
&ldquo;estimate,&rdquo; &ldquo;expect,&rdquo; &ldquo;may,&rdquo; &ldquo;plan,&rdquo; &ldquo;will,&rdquo; &ldquo;would&rsquo;&rsquo; and
other similar expressions are intended to identify these forward-looking statements. Examples of such statements include, but are not
limited to, statements regarding the intended effects of the reverse stock split. Important factors that could cause actual results to
differ materially from those indicated by such forward-looking statements include, without limitation: the Company&rsquo;s ability to
maintain compliance with the Nasdaq Stock Market&rsquo;s listing standards; the timing of, and the Company&rsquo;s ability to, obtain
and maintain regulatory approvals for clinical trials of the Company&rsquo;s pharmaceutical candidates; the timing and results of the
Company&rsquo;s planned clinical trials for its pharmaceutical candidates; the amount of funds the Company requires for its pharmaceutical
candidates; increased levels of competition; changes in political, economic or regulatory conditions generally and in the markets in
which the Company operates; the Company&rsquo;s ability to retain and attract senior management and other key employees; the Company&rsquo;s
ability to quickly and effectively respond to new technological developments; and the Company&rsquo;s ability to protect its trade secrets
or other proprietary rights, operate without infringing upon the proprietary rights of others and prevent others from infringing on the
Company&rsquo;s proprietary rights. A discussion of these and other factors with respect to the Company is set forth in the Company&rsquo;s
Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2024, filed by the Company on April 11, 2025, and subsequent reports that
the Company files with the Securities and Exchange Commission. Forward-looking statements speak only as of the date they are made, and
the Company disclaims any intention or obligation to revise any forward-looking statements, whether as a result of new information, future
events or otherwise.</FONT></P>

